# Assets

All assets needed to run this game are already included in the repository.
Keep the local models, textures, backgrounds, fallback sprites and licences.
Do not generate replacement artwork or rerun importers during migration.

For future asset discovery, use the existing Minimax library through:

    python3 tools/gamekit-agent/gamekit.py search <terms> --limit 5
    python3 tools/gamekit-agent/gamekit.py inspect ASSET_ID

The optional library defaults to ~/.minimax/asset-library; --library PATH
selects another location. Read tools/gamekit-agent/QUICKSTART.md if needed.
Keep queries bounded. No bulk downloads or full archive scans. Empty indexed
results do not prove absence. Unverified 2D entries are review-only.
